    "long_instructions": "# Investigate & Tinker\r\n\r\n**Do This:** \r\n1. Using the program from the last level, discuss with your partner: \r\n   - Which line sets the starting value?\r\n   - Which line checks the condition?\r\n   - Which line updates the variable?\r\n2. Then **tinker**: change the starting value of `steps` to `2` and run it. What changes? \r\n3. Change it back, then change `steps < 4` to `steps < 2`. What changes now?",
